## After the fight

@aria{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Did we win? We won! Those were Hollow hounds. They eat light.
@lumi{code="0010"}: They'll be back. The Hollow King sends them wherever a star falls.
@aria{code="0020"}: Then we don't let them catch any more. Where's the next star?
@lumi{code="0020"}: East. Toward the keep. Of course it's toward the keep.
